flowchart TD
  Input[Compressed ghost bytes] --> Detect[Detect compression and version]
  Detect --> Decode[Decode versioned frames]
  Decode --> Bounds[Check byte, frame, and time limits]
  Bounds -->|valid| Stats[Derive positions, surfaces, and statistics]
  Bounds -->|invalid| Reject[Return decode or validation error]
  Stats --> Consumer[Playback or server validation]
